---
---
<div class="ws-head">
  <div>
    <h1>Label Generator</h1>
    <p>Turn a spreadsheet into a print-ready PDF sheet of QR labels — rows, columns, captions, sized to your page stock.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="privacy-box">
    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.5 13.5 3.6v3.9c0 3.4-2.3 6.3-5.5 7-3.2-.7-5.5-3.6-5.5-7V3.6L8 1.5Z" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    <div><strong>100% Private</strong><span>Everything stays in your browser</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="tier-banner" class="tier-banner">
  <div class="tb-status">
    <strong id="tb-title">Pro feature</strong>
    <span id="tb-desc">Printable label sheets are included with Pro — free and Batch Pass plans can configure a sheet but need Pro to export the PDF.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tb-actions" id="tb-actions">
    <button class="btn btn-accent" id="tb-buy-pro" type="button">Pro — $39</button>
    <button class="link-btn" id="tb-toggle-key" type="button">Have a license key?</button>
  </div>
  <form id="tb-key-form" class="tb-key-form" hidden>
    <input id="tb-key-input" type="text" placeholder="License key" aria-label="License key" autocomplete="off" />
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Unlock</button>
    <button class="link-btn" id="tb-toggle-recover" type="button">Forgot your key?</button>
    <p id="tb-key-error" class="tb-key-error" hidden></p>
  </form>
  <form id="tb-recover-form" class="tb-key-form" hidden>
    <input id="tb-recover-email" type="email" placeholder="Email used at checkout" aria-label="Email used at checkout" autocomplete="email" />
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Send my key</button>
    <p id="tb-recover-status" class="tb-key-status" hidden></p>
  </form>
</div>

<div id="error-banner" class="error-banner" hidden></div>

<div class="panels">
  <section id="upload" class="panel">
    <h2><span class="pn">01</span>Upload file</h2>
    <div id="dropzone" class="dropzone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Upload a CSV file">
      <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-faint)" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M12 3v12M7 10l5-5 5 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 16v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      <p><strong>Drop a CSV file here</strong><br />or click to browse</p>
      <span class="hint">Supports CSV · header row required</span>
    </div>
    <input id="file-input" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" hidden />
    <div id="file-info" class="file-info" hidden>
      <div class="file-info-icon">✓</div>
      <div class="file-info-text">
        <strong id="file-name"></strong>
        <span id="file-rows"></span>
      </div>
      <button id="replace-file" class="btn" type="button">Replace file</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="map" class="panel">
    <h2><span class="pn">02</span>Map columns</h2>
    <div class="field-list">
      <label>QR data <em>(required)</em><select id="map-qrdata" disabled></select></label>
      <label>Label text <em>(optional)</em><select id="map-caption" disabled></select></label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="configure" class="panel">
    <h2><span class="pn">03</span>Configure</h2>
    <div class="field-list">
      <label>Page size<select id="cfg-page">
        <option value="letter" selected>US Letter (8.5 × 11 in)</option>
        <option value="a4">A4 (210 × 297 mm)</option>
      </select></label>
      <div class="field-row">
        <label>Columns<input id="cfg-cols" type="number" min="1" max="10" value="3" /></label>
        <label>Rows<input id="cfg-rows" type="number" min="1" max="15" value="8" /></label>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <label>Margin (mm)<input id="cfg-margin" type="number" min="4" max="30" value="12" /></label>
        <label>Spacing (mm)<input id="cfg-gap" type="number" min="0" max="20" value="4" /></label>
      </div>
      <label>Error correction<select id="cfg-ec">
        <option value="L">L — ~7%</option>
        <option value="M" selected>M — ~15%</option>
        <option value="Q">Q — ~25%</option>
        <option value="H">H — ~30%</option>
      </select></label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="preview" class="panel">
    <h2><span class="pn">04</span>Preview <span id="preview-count" class="preview-count"></span></h2>
    <div id="sheet-preview" class="sheet-preview">
      <p class="empty-note">Upload a CSV to see a live layout preview here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="generate-bar" id="generate">
  <div class="gb-left">
    <strong id="ready-count">Upload a CSV to get started</strong>
    <div class="chips">
      <span id="chip-page">Letter</span>
      <span id="chip-grid">3 × 8 per page</span>
      <span id="chip-pages">—</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="gb-right">
    <span id="gen-progress" class="gen-progress" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <button id="generate-btn" class="btn btn-accent" type="button" disabled>Generate PDF</button>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="gb-note">Generation happens entirely in this browser tab — nothing is uploaded anywhere.</p>

<div class="support-faq">
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <details class="faq-item">
    <summary>What columns does my CSV need?</summary>
    <p>At minimum, one column with the QR content (a URL or any text). A second column for label text under each code is optional.</p>
  </details>
  <details class="faq-item">
    <summary>What page sizes are supported?</summary>
    <p>US Letter and A4 today. Columns, rows, margin, and spacing between labels are all adjustable to fit common label stock.</p>
  </details>
  <details class="faq-item">
    <summary>Is this the same as the bulk ZIP generator?</summary>
    <p>No — the <a href="/bulk-qr-code-generator">bulk workspace</a> exports individual SVG/PNG files in a ZIP. This exports one print-ready PDF with your codes laid out in a grid, ready to print and cut.</p>
  </details>
  <details class="faq-item">
    <summary>Is this a Pro-only feature?</summary>
    <p>Yes — configuring and previewing a sheet is free, but exporting the PDF requires an unlocked Pro license. A Batch Pass doesn't cover this; see the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a>.</p>
  </details>
</div>

<script>
  import { renderQR } from "../lib/qr.js";
  import { parseCSV, guessColumn } from "../lib/csv.js";
  import {
    newJobId,
    startCheckout,
    resolvePendingCheckout,
    redeemLicenseKey,
    requestLicenseRecovery,
    getStoredPayment,
    verifyAccessForJob,
  } from "../lib/bulk/license.js";
  import { jsPDF } from "jspdf";

  const el = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const dropzone = el("dropzone");
  const fileInput = el("file-input");
  const fileInfo = el("file-info");
  const errorBanner = el("error-banner");

  // Labels are Pro-only -- there's no per-file Batch Pass equivalent for a
  // printed sheet, so the jobId passed around here is only ever used to
  // satisfy verifyAccessForJob()'s signature, never to scope anything.
  const dummyJobId = newJobId();

  const tierBanner = {
    title: el("tb-title"),
    desc: el("tb-desc"),
    buyPro: el("tb-buy-pro"),
    toggleKey: el("tb-toggle-key"),
    keyForm: el("tb-key-form"),
    keyInput: el("tb-key-input"),
    keyError: el("tb-key-error"),
    toggleRecover: el("tb-toggle-recover"),
    recoverForm: el("tb-recover-form"),
    recoverEmail: el("tb-recover-email"),
    recoverStatus: el("tb-recover-status"),
  };

  let isPro = false;

  function renderTierBanner() {
    if (isPro) {
      tierBanner.title.textContent = "Pro unlocked";
      tierBanner.desc.textContent = "Printable label sheets are unlocked in this browser.";
      tierBanner.buyPro.hidden = true;
      tierBanner.toggleKey.hidden = true;
      tierBanner.keyForm.hidden = true;
      tierBanner.recoverForm.hidden = true;
    } else {
      tierBanner.title.textContent = "Pro feature";
      tierBanner.desc.textContent = "Printable label sheets are included with Pro — free and Batch Pass plans can configure a sheet but need Pro to export the PDF.";
      tierBanner.buyPro.hidden = false;
      tierBanner.toggleKey.hidden = false;
    }
    updateBottomBar();
  }

  tierBanner.toggleKey.addEventListener("click", () => {
    tierBanner.keyForm.hidden = !tierBanner.keyForm.hidden;
    tierBanner.recoverForm.hidden = true;
  });
  tierBanner.toggleRecover.addEventListener("click", () => {
    tierBanner.recoverForm.hidden = !tierBanner.recoverForm.hidden;
  });
  tierBanner.buyPro.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    tierBanner.buyPro.disabled = true;
    try {
      await startCheckout("pro", dummyJobId, "/labels");
    } catch (err) {
      tierBanner.keyError.textContent = err.message;
      tierBanner.keyError.hidden = false;
      tierBanner.keyForm.hidden = false;
      tierBanner.buyPro.disabled = false;
    }
  });
  tierBanner.keyForm.addEventListener("submit", async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const key = tierBanner.keyInput.value.trim();
    if (!key) return;
    tierBanner.keyError.hidden = true;
    try {
      const record = await redeemLicenseKey(key, "");
      isPro = record.tier === "pro";
      if (!isPro) {
        tierBanner.keyError.textContent = "That's a Batch Pass key — printable sheets need a Pro license.";
        tierBanner.keyError.hidden = false;
      }
      renderTierBanner();
    } catch (err) {
      tierBanner.keyError.textContent = err.message;
      tierBanner.keyError.hidden = false;
    }
  });
  tierBanner.recoverForm.addEventListener("submit", async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const email = tierBanner.recoverEmail.value.trim();
    if (!email) return;
    tierBanner.recoverStatus.hidden = true;
    try {
      const message = await requestLicenseRecovery(email);
      tierBanner.recoverStatus.textContent = message;
      tierBanner.recoverStatus.hidden = false;
    } catch (err) {
      tierBanner.recoverStatus.textContent = err.message;
      tierBanner.recoverStatus.hidden = false;
    }
  });

  async function initTierBanner() {
    let resumed = null;
    try {
      resumed = await resolvePendingCheckout();
    } catch {
      resumed = { failed: true };
    }
    if (resumed?.failed) {
      showError("Payment wasn't completed — nothing was charged.");
    }
    const stored = getStoredPayment();
    if (stored?.tier === "pro") {
      // Re-verify live rather than trusting localStorage indefinitely --
      // same rule the bulk workspace's export path follows.
      const access = await verifyAccessForJob(dummyJobId).catch(() => stored);
      isPro = access?.tier === "pro";
    }
    renderTierBanner();
  }

  const mapSelects = { qrData: el("map-qrdata"), caption: el("map-caption") };
  const cfgPage = el("cfg-page");
  const cfgCols = el("cfg-cols");
  const cfgRows = el("cfg-rows");
  const cfgMargin = el("cfg-margin");
  const cfgGap = el("cfg-gap");
  const cfgEc = el("cfg-ec");

  const sheetPreview = el("sheet-preview");
  const previewCount = el("preview-count");
  const readyCount = el("ready-count");
  const generateBtn = el("generate-btn");
  const genProgress = el("gen-progress");

  const PAGE_SIZES = { letter: { w: 215.9, h: 279.4 }, a4: { w: 210, h: 297 } };

  let state = { headers: [], rows: [] };

  function showError(msg) {
    errorBanner.textContent = msg;
    errorBanner.hidden = false;
  }
  function clearError() {
    errorBanner.hidden = true;
  }

  function markStepDone(id) {
    const link = document.querySelector(`.side-link[data-step="${id}"]`);
    if (link) link.classList.add("is-done");
  }

  async function handleFile(file) {
    clearError();
    if (!/\.csv$/i.test(file.name)) {
      showError(`"${file.name}" isn't a CSV file. Export your spreadsheet as CSV and try again.`);
      return;
    }
    const text = await file.text();
    const { headers, rows } = parseCSV(text);
    if (headers.length === 0 || rows.length === 0) {
      showError("That CSV looks empty, or has no header row.");
      return;
    }
    state = { headers, rows };

    fileInfo.hidden = false;
    el("file-name").textContent = file.name;
    el("file-rows").textContent = `${rows.length.toLocaleString()} rows`;

    populateMapping();
    markStepDone("upload");
    markStepDone("map");
    markStepDone("configure");
    markStepDone("preview");
    renderSheetPreview();
    updateBottomBar();
  }

  function populateMapping() {
    const { headers } = state;
    const qrGuess = guessColumn(headers, ["url", "link", "website"], headers[0]);
    const capGuess = guessColumn(headers, ["name", "product", "sku", "title", "caption", "label"]);
    mapSelects.qrData.innerHTML = headers.map((h) => `<option ${h === qrGuess ? "selected" : ""}>${h}</option>`).join("");
    mapSelects.caption.innerHTML = `<option value="">None</option>` + headers.map((h) => `<option ${h === capGuess ? "selected" : ""}>${h}</option>`).join("");
    Object.values(mapSelects).forEach((s) => (s.disabled = false));
  }

  function currentMapping() {
    return { qrData: mapSelects.qrData.value, caption: mapSelects.caption.value };
  }

  function gridConfig() {
    const cols = Math.max(1, Math.min(10, Number(cfgCols.value) || 1));
    const rows = Math.max(1, Math.min(15, Number(cfgRows.value) || 1));
    const margin = Math.max(0, Number(cfgMargin.value) || 0);
    const gap = Math.max(0, Number(cfgGap.value) || 0);
    const page = PAGE_SIZES[cfgPage.value] || PAGE_SIZES.letter;
    const usableW = page.w - margin * 2;
    const usableH = page.h - margin * 2;
    const cellW = (usableW - (cols - 1) * gap) / cols;
    const cellH = (usableH - (rows - 1) * gap) / rows;
    return { cols, rows, margin, gap, page, cellW, cellH, perPage: cols * rows };
  }

  function renderSheetPreview() {
    const { cols, rows, perPage } = gridConfig();
    const n = state.rows.length;
    sheetPreview.innerHTML = "";
    if (!n) {
      sheetPreview.innerHTML = `<p class="empty-note">Upload a CSV to see a live layout preview here.</p>`;
      previewCount.textContent = "";
      return;
    }
    const grid = document.createElement("div");
    grid.className = "sheet-grid";
    grid.style.gridTemplateColumns = `repeat(${cols}, 1fr)`;
    const mapping = currentMapping();
    const shown = Math.min(perPage, n);
    state.rows.slice(0, shown).forEach((row) => {
      const cell = document.createElement("div");
      cell.className = "sheet-cell";
      const canvas = document.createElement("canvas");
      canvas.width = 120;
      canvas.height = 120;
      cell.appendChild(canvas);
      if (mapping.caption) {
        const cap = document.createElement("span");
        cap.textContent = row[mapping.caption] || "";
        cell.appendChild(cap);
      }
      grid.appendChild(cell);
      const value = row[mapping.qrData] || "";
      if (value) renderQR(canvas, value, { width: 120, margin: 1 });
    });
    sheetPreview.appendChild(grid);
    const pages = Math.ceil(n / perPage);
    previewCount.textContent = `— first ${shown} of ${n.toLocaleString()} (page 1 of ${pages.toLocaleString()})`;
  }

  function updateBottomBar() {
    const n = state.rows.length;
    const { cols, rows, perPage } = gridConfig();
    readyCount.textContent = n ? `${n.toLocaleString()} labels ready to lay out` : "Upload a CSV to get started";
    el("chip-page").textContent = cfgPage.value === "a4" ? "A4" : "Letter";
    el("chip-grid").textContent = `${cols} × ${rows} per page`;
    el("chip-pages").textContent = n ? `${Math.ceil(n / perPage).toLocaleString()} page${Math.ceil(n / perPage) === 1 ? "" : "s"}` : "—";
    generateBtn.disabled = n === 0 || !isPro;
    generateBtn.textContent = !isPro && n > 0 ? "Unlock Pro to generate PDF" : "Generate PDF";
  }

  dropzone.addEventListener("click", () => fileInput.click());
  dropzone.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
    if (e.key === "Enter" || e.key === " ") {
      e.preventDefault();
      fileInput.click();
    }
  });
  dropzone.addEventListener("dragover", (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    dropzone.classList.add("is-drag");
  });
  dropzone.addEventListener("dragleave", () => dropzone.classList.remove("is-drag"));
  dropzone.addEventListener("drop", (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    dropzone.classList.remove("is-drag");
    const file = e.dataTransfer?.files?.[0];
    if (file) handleFile(file);
  });
  fileInput.addEventListener("change", () => {
    const file = fileInput.files?.[0];
    if (file) handleFile(file);
  });
  el("replace-file").addEventListener("click", () => fileInput.click());

  Object.values(mapSelects).forEach((sel) => sel.addEventListener("change", renderSheetPreview));
  [cfgPage, cfgCols, cfgRows, cfgMargin, cfgGap].forEach((elm) => {
    elm.addEventListener("change", () => {
      renderSheetPreview();
      updateBottomBar();
    });
  });

  async function runGeneratePDF() {
    if (!state.rows.length || !isPro) return;
    generateBtn.disabled = true;
    const mapping = currentMapping();
    const ec = cfgEc.value;
    const { cols, rows, margin, gap, page, cellW, cellH, perPage } = gridConfig();
    const hasCaption = Boolean(mapping.caption);
    const qrSize = Math.min(cellW, cellH) * (hasCaption ? 0.72 : 0.9);
    const captionFontMM = 3;

    const doc = new jsPDF({ unit: "mm", format: [page.w, page.h] });
    const canvas = document.createElement("canvas");
    let written = 0;

    for (let i = 0; i < state.rows.length; i++) {
      const row = state.rows[i];
      const value = row[mapping.qrData];
      if (!value) continue;

      const posInPage = written % perPage;
      if (posInPage === 0 && written > 0) doc.addPage([page.w, page.h]);
      const colIdx = posInPage % cols;
      const rowIdx = Math.floor(posInPage / cols);
      const cellX = margin + colIdx * (cellW + gap);
      const cellY = margin + rowIdx * (cellH + gap);
      const qrX = cellX + (cellW - qrSize) / 2;
      const qrY = cellY + (cellH - qrSize - (hasCaption ? captionFontMM + 2 : 0)) / 2;

      await renderQR(canvas, value, { errorCorrectionLevel: ec, width: 300, margin: 1 });
      const dataUrl = canvas.toDataURL("image/png");
      doc.addImage(dataUrl, "PNG", qrX, qrY, qrSize, qrSize);

      if (hasCaption) {
        const label = String(row[mapping.caption] || "").slice(0, 40);
        if (label) {
          doc.setFontSize(captionFontMM * 2.83); // mm -> pt
          doc.text(label, cellX + cellW / 2, qrY + qrSize + captionFontMM + 0.5, { align: "center", maxWidth: cellW });
        }
      }

      written++;
      if (i % 15 === 0) {
        genProgress.textContent = `Laying out… ${written.toLocaleString()}/${state.rows.length.toLocaleString()}`;
        await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 0));
      }
    }

    genProgress.textContent = `Saving PDF (${written.toLocaleString()} labels)…`;
    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 0));
    doc.save("qrworkbench-labels.pdf");
    genProgress.textContent = `Done — downloaded qrworkbench-labels.pdf (${written.toLocaleString()} labels, ${doc.getNumberOfPages()} page${doc.getNumberOfPages() === 1 ? "" : "s"})`;
    generateBtn.disabled = false;
  }

  generateBtn.addEventListener("click", runGeneratePDF);

  updateBottomBar();
  initTierBanner();
</script>

<style>
  .ws-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .ws-head h1 { font-size: 1.55rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .ws-head p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.9rem; max-width: 48ch; }
  .privacy-box { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; }
  .privacy-box strong { display: block; font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .privacy-box span { display: block; font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .error-banner { border: 1px solid var(--red); background: #FDECE8; color: #9A2A14; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }

  .tier-banner {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .tb-status { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; min-width: 0; max-width: 40ch; }
  .tb-status strong { font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .tb-status span { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .tb-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tb-actions .btn { font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem; }
  .link-btn { font: inherit; font-size: 0.78rem; background: none; border: none; color: var(--red); text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; padding: 0; }
  .tb-key-form { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.9rem; padding-top: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tb-key-form input { flex: 1; min-width: 180px; font: inherit; font-size: 0.82rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); }
  .tb-key-form .btn { font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem; }
  .tb-key-error { color: var(--red); font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0; width: 100%; }
  .tb-key-status { color: var(--success); font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0; width: 100%; }

  .panels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  .panel { position: relative; padding: 1.4rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); min-width: 0; }
  .panel:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .panel h2 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; }
  .pn { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--red); border: 1px solid var(--red); border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; }
  .preview-count { font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 0.72rem; }

  .dropzone {
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--line); padding: 1.6rem 1rem; text-align: center; cursor: pointer;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
    transition: border-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-standard), background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-standard);
  }
  .dropzone:hover, .dropzone.is-drag, .dropzone:focus-visible { border-color: var(--red); background: #FFF6F4; }
  .dropzone p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .dropzone .hint { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }

